02:46:41,968 --> 02:46:46,426
There is a secure research facility. It's under the
old building. It's better equipped

2088
02:46:46,446 --> 02:46:50,956
than anything the government has, and it's working
on things that would terrify the FDA

2089
02:46:50,976 --> 02:46:55,486
and — one day — save more lives than Aeterna ever
will. It isn't on any drawing because

2090
02:46:55,506 --> 02:46:59,912
the people who draw buildings can't be trusted with
what's in this one. It's legal in

2091
02:46:59,932 --> 02:47:02,672
