2140
02:50:55,504 --> 02:51:01,795
on Earth that did the kinds of work Umbrella would
need over the next ten years. Structural

2141
02:51:01,815 --> 02:51:07,897
biology. Medicinal chemistry. Protein design.
Immunology. Neuroscience. Forty people who

2142
02:51:07,917 --> 02:51:12,890
were, by the measure of their peers, the best
in the world at one thing.

2143
02:51:13,461 --> 02:51:19,632
He met twenty-six of them himself. He recruited
twenty-two. He did it in fourteen weeks,

2144
02:51:19,652 --> 02:51:26,245
on four continents, and he used, depending on the
