two days. He was good at it. On the

2161
02:52:43,429 --> 02:52:49,125
third morning, Wesker slid a single sheet of paper
across the table with a number on it,

2162
02:52:49,145 --> 02:52:54,841
and Lukas Ammann stopped negotiating, and looked at
