2194
02:55:27,629 --> 02:55:29,912
Come to Delaware. I'll show you
what's true.

2195
02:55:31,932 --> 02:55:37,775
It is important to be precise about what happened
here, because Albert Wesker was always

2196
02:55:37,795 --> 02:55:43,438
