2200
02:55:55,801 --> 02:55:56,562
Time.

2201
02:55:57,251 --> 02:55:59,128
That was well done.

2202
02:55:59,648 --> 02:56:00,777
It was a kindness.

2203
02:56:01,297 --> 02:56:04,035
Yes. That is what made it well done.

2204
02:56:06,056 --> 02:56:11,126
The twenty-two humans came from outside. The
