2236
02:58:38,481 --> 02:58:38,864
sheet.

2237
02:58:40,184 --> 02:58:41,238
Ten draws.

2238
02:58:48,049 --> 02:58:49,146
Results.

2239
02:58:59,104 --> 02:58:59,936
Jet lag.

2240
02:59:00,456 --> 02:59:02,335
Fate is mocking you.

2241
02:59:02,855 --> 02:59:08,646
Fate has just made me the only chief executive in
