years could go, and chose one.

2257
03:00:27,292 --> 03:00:28,513
Then he let go.

2258
03:00:29,883 --> 03:00:35,353
The raindrop streaked across the glass and was gone.
On the other side of the cabin, his

2259
03:00:35,373 --> 03:00:40,780
new executive assistant — who had appeared in the
rear seat of the jet at the moment of

2260
03:00:40,800 --> 03:00:46,207
the draw, already dressed, already holding a tablet
