4134
05:37:42,717 --> 05:37:43,789
Status.

4135
05:37:48,957 --> 05:37:50,582
Charisma fifty-five.

4136
05:37:51,152 --> 05:37:57,194
There is no human scale for that number. Twenty is
the limit of what the human voice has

4137
05:37:57,215 --> 05:38:03,327
