4186
05:42:11,265 --> 05:42:13,704
I don't know yet. Somebody who isn't us.

4187
05:42:16,224 --> 05:42:18,584
So ended the war with the agencies.

4188
05:42:19,155 --> 05:42:25,594
It had lasted two years. It had cost the lives of
Howard Lessing and sixteen men with

4189
05:42:25,614 --> 05:42:32,812
