4208
05:44:32,831 --> 05:44:39,073
three hundred billion dollars of market value, and a
hundred and forty years of history.

4209
05:44:39,093 --> 05:44:45,263
It had made the first mass-produced penicillin in
Europe. It had made the vaccines that

4210
05:44:45,283 --> 05:44:51,525
