4261
05:48:52,444 --> 05:48:53,128
I know.

4262
05:48:53,647 --> 05:48:55,599
Then you know there is no debt.

4263
05:48:56,118 --> 05:49:02,050
There's always a debt, Doctor Halvorsen. The only
