4779
06:32:55,736 --> 06:33:02,020
And in the same week, Umbrella quietly bought Lumen's
life-sciences cloud division — the

4780
06:33:02,040 --> 06:33:08,395
servers that ran half the world's drug discovery —
for a price Crane's successor accepted

4781
06:33:08,415 --> 06:33:12,120
