4794
06:34:13,591 --> 06:34:14,680
What are you?

4795
06:34:16,699 --> 06:34:22,782
The Director did not answer. He looked at the young
man dripping on his carpet — brilliant,

4796
06:34:22,802 --> 06:34:28,616
arrogant, ruined, and still, even now, even here,
burning with that childish total envy

4797
06:34:28,636 --> 06:34:34,315
— and the Cold-Read showed him something that he
had seen before, in a break room, in

4798
06:34:34,335 --> 06:34:36,797
