4852
06:39:38,470 --> 06:39:43,119
You are walking into their city. Into
their net. With two guards.

4853
06:39:43,638 --> 06:39:48,755
I'm walking into a conference, with two guards and a
keynote. And I'd like to meet the

4854
06:39:48,775 --> 06:39:53,832
woman who's been watching me for three years. She's
the only one of them who's clever

4855
06:39:53,852 --> 06:39:55,325
