4856
06:39:55,846 --> 06:39:57,917
And if she tries to take you?

4857
06:39:58,436 --> 06:40:03,544
Then I'll learn something about Chinese
intelligence. And she'll learn something about

4858
06:40:03,564 --> 06:40:03,722
me.

4859
06:40:05,744 --> 06:40:07,548
