4867
06:40:50,875 --> 06:40:54,854
could have put down a horse, and a van
in the loading bay.

4868
06:40:55,424 --> 06:41:00,769
He walked into the corridor on purpose. He had
watched them take their positions, in the

4869
06:41:00,789 --> 06:41:06,012
Thought Acceleration, from the other side of the
door. Three trains of thought, at six

4870
06:41:06,032 --> 06:41:11,376
hundred to one. In one of them, he had already
