4898
06:43:20,575 --> 06:43:27,213
She smiled, very slightly. It was the first smile
anyone at the Ministry of State Security

4899
06:43:27,233 --> 06:43:29,950
had seen from her in seventeen years.

4900
06:43:30,640 --> 06:43:33,082
That is either a kindness or a threat.

4901
06:43:33,602 --> 06:43:37,333
In my experience, the most useful
things usually are both.

4902
06:43:39,352 --> 06:43:45,229
They talked for two hours. Neither of them lied,
exactly. Neither of them told the truth,

4903
06:43:45,249 --> 06:43:50,927
either. It was, the Director would reflect
