5727
07:54:51,400 --> 07:54:57,515
Ninety-one percent. Two divergences in a year — two
arguments, out of a thousand, in which

5728
07:54:57,534 --> 07:55:01,196
the two of them had genuinely wanted
different things.

5729
07:55:01,765 --> 07:55:04,386
In the first year there had been
four hundred.

5730
07:55:06,957 --> 07:55:10,683
He stood on the terrace for a long
time and did not go in.

5731
07:55:11,254 --> 07:55:16,798
He was not afraid of very much by then. But he
understood, looking at that number, that

5732
07:55:16,818 --> 07:55:22,235
there was a day coming — not soon, but coming —
