5773
07:59:29,529 --> 07:59:30,539
A vote.

5774
07:59:31,061 --> 07:59:31,765
A vote.

5775
07:59:32,286 --> 07:59:37,985
I took a country with a vote. They have never
forgiven me for it, and they have spent

5776
07:59:38,005 --> 07:59:41,013
