5814
08:02:51,786 --> 08:02:56,581
metres from the stage, and that it had been
the work of nineteen months.

5815
08:02:57,152 --> 08:03:02,963
It killed four people. A sound engineer named Peter
Aebi. Two members of the cantonal

5816
08:03:02,983 --> 08:03:08,931
police. And Ursula Frey, who had been standing much
