5899
08:09:35,934 --> 08:09:37,145
So you keep me.

5900
08:09:37,664 --> 08:09:38,540
I keep you.

5901
08:09:39,060 --> 08:09:40,619
And the channel to London?

5902
08:09:41,140 --> 08:09:46,437
Stays open. You'll go on sending your reports. I'd
