Nineteen thousand people went in the first wave.
Four hundred thousand had volunteered.

6921
09:39:56,623 --> 09:40:02,658
The selection criteria were published in full, and
were scrupulously fair, and one of

6922
09:40:02,678 --> 09:40:08,855
the eleven criteria was loyalty, and it was listed
fourth, and nobody objected, because

6923
09:40:08,875 --> 09:40:12,274
by twenty sixty-one nobody
objected to anything.

6924
09:40:14,843 --> 09:40:20,672
Evelyn Marsh moved her laboratory to orbit in twenty
fifty-eight. She was sixty-two years

6925
09:40:20,692 --> 09:40:22,973
old and looked perhaps thirty-five.

6926
09:40:23,543 --> 09:40:29,187
The Progenitor Initiative had eleven hundred staff
by then, and the great majority of

6927
