them had never been human in the way that word is
usually meant. Its work had three branches.

6928
09:40:35,405 --> 09:40:41,383
The first was the quiet ones, and there were now four
hundred of them, in positions across

6929
09:40:41,403 --> 09:40:45,516
the Directorate, and none of them had
ever disobeyed anything.

6930
09:40:46,086 --> 09:40:51,834
The second was the Tyrant line, which had moved on
considerably from a grey giant in a

6931
09:40:51,854 --> 09:40:57,670
cradle. There were nine variants by twenty
