7013
09:48:32,778 --> 09:48:33,906
Don't say it.

7014
09:48:34,427 --> 09:48:35,771
I haven't said anything.

7015
09:48:36,290 --> 09:48:40,422
You're about to. You're going to tell me there's an
infusion, and that it would take an

7016
09:48:40,442 --> 09:48:42,521
