7049
09:50:49,325 --> 09:50:49,965
Yes.

7050
09:50:51,985 --> 09:50:53,172
Thank you.

7051
09:50:55,692 --> 09:51:01,689
She died four days later, in the afternoon, in the
chair by the window, with a book she

7052
09:51:01,709 --> 09:51:03,073
