7066
09:52:16,756 --> 09:52:18,590
That lasted eleven months.

7067
09:52:22,161 --> 09:52:27,326
The thing that had been working out there came into
the solar system in the autumn of

7068
09:52:27,346 --> 09:52:31,962
twenty seventy-four, and it did not come
quietly, and it did not come alone.

7069
09:52:32,532 --> 09:52:38,269
There were nine of them. They crossed the heliopause
