7098
09:55:11,726 --> 09:55:12,854
Somebody had to.

7099
09:55:15,424 --> 09:55:21,139
One of the nine came in to Earth orbit, and it was
eleven kilometres long, and it took

7100
09:55:21,159 --> 09:55:27,074
station four hundred kilometres above the Pacific,
and it did nothing threatening at all,

7101
09:55:27,094 --> 09:55:33,143
